# WHITELIST. Everything is ignored unless listed below.
# Only our own source, sheets (structure + status, never game data), docs and license texts are tracked, plus (RULES C5,
# 2026-10-22) the process tooling: tools/ (scripts), agents/ (rules, guides, brief templates), scenarios/ (rig scenarios) and
# .cargo/ (build settings). None of them may hold game data, decompiled text, save states, recordings or machine paths
# (those live in the untracked local/machine.ps1).
# Never tracked: the ISO, anything extracted or decompiled from it, caches, the OpenKH filename list
# (downloaded by `kh2 fetch-names` into local/), build output, screenshots.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/README.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/rust-toolchain.toml
!/crates/
!/sheets/
!/docs/
!/third_party/
!/tools/
!/agents/
!/scenarios/
!/.cargo/

# Inside tracked folders: still never commit binaries or game-derived files.
*.iso
*.bin
*.img
*.idx
*.elf
*.png
*.dds
*.wav
*.exe
*.dll
target/
# Save states and recordings never enter tools/, agents/ or scenarios/.
*.p2s
*.p2m2
*.mp4
*.webp
*.jpg
__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/local/
# The Save menu's slot files (progress::save_dir; KH2_SAVE_DIR may name any folder, it is the user's own).
local/saves/
saves/
